// The assistant service (Part B, Week 5): conversations, streamed to the browser over
// gRPC-Web through Envoy (spec D-30). Server-streaming only -- the shape gRPC-Web supports,
// and the shape of a chat turn.
//
// A turn is free text *or* a structured answer to something the assistant offered:
// a choice from an Options list, or a decision on a ConfirmationRequired. The assistant
// answers with a stream that mixes prose (token) with interactive parts the client renders
